         POTENTIAL GTH-PBE-q4
         RADIAL_GRID 50
         LEBEDEV_GRID 50
         HARD_EXP_RADIUS 1.52
      &END KIND
      &TOPOLOGY
         &CENTER_COORDINATES
         &END CENTER_COORDINATES
      &END TOPOLOGY
